    "pre_fix_provisioner_home_requirement": "exact-0700",
    "observed_safe_home_example": "0755",
    "managed_directory_requirement": "exact-0700",
    "pre_fix_downstream_behavior": "The readiness, authority, instance-enrollment, and approved-key-enrollment paths did not impose the provisioner's exact-0700 home rule; their namespace checks could accept home or intermediate-directory states that the provisioner rejected, including unsafe group-or-other-writable anchors or intermediate components.",
    "downstream_consistency_hardening": "All five production paths now share the same safe canonical home-anchor predicate and exact-0700 managed-child predicate so provision, inspection, authority, readiness, and enrollment agree on namespace validity.",
